# Ghostty configuration.
# cmux is Ghostty-based and honors the same config keys, so this file is
# shared by both. Keep overrides minimal — rely on upstream defaults.
#
# ── Terminal stack decision (2026-06, FROZEN) ─────────────────────────
# Daily driver : cmux — for its agent-aware sidebar / notifications / `cmux diff`.
#                Embedded browser disabled in ~/.config/cmux/cmux.json; links
#                open in the system browser. View an agent's last change with
#                `cmux diff --last-turn` instead of opening an external tool.
# Persistence  : tmux (not zellij), used SELECTIVELY for tasks that must survive
#                detach / a front-end crash, and to attach from another device
#                over ssh/mosh. See `tw` and `wt`/`wtrm` in ~/.zshrc.
# FOMO gate    : do NOT switch terminals (Prowl / Otty / $next_shiny) unless it
#                does something cmux OR tmux *structurally cannot*. UI/aesthetic
#                upgrades do NOT count. cmux↔Prowl↔Otty are one category — churn
#                only re-pays the integration tax. Read this before tinkering.
#
# Reference: ghostty +show-config --default --docs
# Docs:      https://ghostty.org/docs/config

font-family = FiraCode Nerd Font
font-size = 13
